WEBVTT

0
00:00:00.689 --> 00:00:03.890
Scientists use RAP to remember the parts of a chemical equation,

1
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:04.690
reactants,

2
00:00:04.769 --> 00:00:05.170
arrow,

3
00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:06.230
and products.

4
00:00:06.809 --> 00:00:09.119
Notice that atoms are not created or destroyed.

5
00:00:09.329 --> 00:00:12.890
They are simply rearranged into new substances during chemical reactions.
